{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0e895a88a7a161ba4d444e492153685f38b79af1af3ed0683352ef2f53aa6dc3","ja":"激闘！　蒸気船レース！","zh":"激战！蒸汽船竞速！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2a8e54204d09c25c9fbc3f92df924932d97ba112b3c53b44abf1b95e2485b810","ja":"全員、準備は終わった？\nそれじゃあ、位置について、よーい……ドン！","zh":"大家都准备好了吗？\n那么，各就各位，预备……跑！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c888718bfaaa3637ad04a67bc8d64c096409a3bc28cb690b429b7a082dafdd38","ja":"あ！　桃子と美奈子さんの船、いい感じじゃない？\n絵だけのシンプルなかざりにして正解だったかも♪","zh":"啊！桃子和美奈子小姐的船，感觉挺不错的嘛？\n只用图画做简易装饰说不定选对了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5c646938aff426ab60482cd4c96416c204c11b2936764a82ecf3d4c2f89f2bca","ja":"うう、私のは遅いです……。\n星とかハートのかざりが重かったのかな……。","zh":"呜呜，我的好慢啊……\n是因为星星和心形装饰太重了吗……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"aee76095cf6353b90138e5758c0d4222e7f875da426c8c6df6d216ccfd0bd085","ja":"あれぇ！？　たまきの、ヒーローいっぱい船が\n進む前にしずんじゃったぞ～！？","zh":"咦！？环的满载英雄之船\n还没开就沉下去了～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"14c32ea5dadf8079c110e66003ea699b819feee2c5d596244fc06040dfed8883","ja":"私のも、転覆するかもって不安になって、おもりを\nつけすぎちゃったみたい。すっごく遅いよ……。","zh":"我的好像也是，因为担心会翻船，配重\n加得太多了。速度超级慢的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"19b48ee75db89a2ab2a537249d6c809e691cbee35ce9310fcf23539c21c0496e","ja":"にゃははっ♪　アタシのがダントツでトップだね！\n船を削ってスピードアップ作戦、大成功～♪","zh":"喵哈哈♪　我的是遥遥领先的第一名呢！\n削减船身提速大作战，大成功～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c31f2c8b5705113e39190745c98451cda46cf268b3d7a0e835ce7cc6337ac88c","ja":"このままゴールを……って、ありゃ？\nなんか急にすごい曲がり始めた……。","zh":"就这样冲向终点……咦，奇怪？\n怎么突然转了个大弯……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ea8b9ace7984091e64bc9dd9e2d0805d13c0b784047a2bf734c70a59ba188a9c","ja":"あ、ちょ、待った待った！　それじゃコースアウト\nどころか完全に逆走だって～っ！","zh":"啊、等、等等等等！那样不仅会冲出赛道，\n根本就是完全在逆行啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8a111c6005dadd6ee7dd47864cbde547a1cf52aa173d910a5eda2e7b59c44563","ja":"ガシャーーーン！！","zh":"哐啷啷——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"f73ea37145b2be93d1a9517f13eb8efe0ef17be2ab97a11c45635a96f460f68d","ja":"ああっ！　みんなの船が……！","zh":"啊啊！　大家的船……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"5065508758aca7ac195517ff65833ccb30fcae770ce56333e2eb612ddb0edc81","ja":"恵美ちゃんの船の勢いがすごくて、\nみんなのを巻き込んでひっくり返っちゃった……。","zh":"恵美的船冲劲太猛了，\n把大家的船都卷了进去，全都翻掉了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"73b9c3e102a0c31d3fee4a616c5c3401ffe9e92b2d745cca28b8bdec9db73721","ja":"うう、ごめん～。\nまさかこんなオチになっちゃうなんて……。","zh":"呜呜，抱歉～\n真没想到居然会变成这种收场……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"4407c679e4385bd7bcebcd5a2210680b5e41bcadb87f0921ef58c49986144176","ja":"ま、まあ、わざとじゃないんだし……。\nレースも楽しかったし、気にしないで。","zh":"哎、哎呀，反、反正也不是故意的嘛……\n比赛也很开心，别往心里去啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"34f59c395daad556ff8264fc8d253676190898ebe19e69ed93245859ccee0028","ja":"そうだぞ！　今日はいろんなこと、お勉強できたし。\n蒸気の力ってすごいんだね！","zh":"没错！今天学到了好多东西呢。\n蒸汽的力量真厉害呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"d56d8ebd18a5013178f8f073fe1924365ab8d4a0b0f453e1b94454ab5e2d9a83","ja":"……そう、だね。さっきのハプニングも、\n番組的には盛り上がったから、よかったのかも！","zh":"……也是，呢。刚才的突发状况，\n以节目效果来说也挺热闹的，或许反而挺好吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1653.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"e8e2d9b0989aa346bdb166624dd17bb53c72f9109ad7c6c24e6e5277958b8728","ja":"それじゃあ番組はここまで！\nアタシ達の映画も、よろしくね～っ！","zh":"那么节目就到这里！\n我们的电影也要多多支持哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
